   },
   {
    "q": "In communication design, how does what you say relate to how you say it?",
    "options": [
     "They are unrelated",
     "What you are saying determines how you say it and how it is delivered",
     "The medium always comes first",
     "The client's logo decides both"
    ],
    "answer": 1,
